{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ossel\u2019s Odyssey is a quirky 2.5D side-scrolling platformer in the spirit of classic Rayman-style games, but with its own absurd, dry sense of humor. Originally created by Oliver Stephan (creaturelab3d), it blends nostalgic gameplay with oddball surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can discover strange graffiti, unlock hidden music tracks, and stumble across unexpected moments that might just make you blow air through your nose. Whether you\u2019re chasing high scores or simply exploring, the world is packed with subtle jokes and little mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Oliver Stephan creaturelab3d and Juri Knauth, past members, Carla Heinzel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for X-Box controller. To make the X-Box controller work, please follow this:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Steam: right-click your game \u2192 Properties \u2192 Controller \u2192 \u201cOverride for o_Ossel\u00b4s Odyssey\u201d \u2192 Disable Steam Input.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4031650?t=1760720308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031650/5f1f55ea69c51b96d9d113f3a0eefc74c8e6e047/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760720308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031650/d1b571a95010411cb6deebab5ba4214f8edc5c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760720308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4031650/d1b571a95010411cb6deebab5ba4214f8edc5c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760720308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\